UNIFORM_SYMBOLIC_BRANCHES
SAFE_INTERVAL: rho=(mu-1/13)/B and w>T=1/(13*rho) imply 2*rho>2/(13*w), so a connected core-safe interval cannot lie in one w-tooth
R_GE_7 r= 7: r does not divide k -> t=1/7 has clearance >=1/7; r divides k -> w>=14r=98>T=14
